{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever played real golf? It's nothing like most golf games. You don't just tap a few buttons  and then hit a perfect 250 yard drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In real golf, you miss. You slice. You swear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luke Muscat's Ultimate Golf Challenge is the most accurate simulation of the amateur golfer experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and detailed club swing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult and  surreal challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Motion Video mixed with 3D courses</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luke Muscat's Ultimate Golf Challenge was built almost entirely by me, Luke Muscat. Back in the Old Times I was creator of Jetpack Joyride and Fruit Ninja. A couple of years ago I decided I wanted to try the ultimate game dev challenge and make a game completely solo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired by some weird combination of Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy, Trickshot Simulator, and Jetpack Joyride. Yeah, I know. I'm also  documenting the development process on YouTube if you want to see how the sausage is made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This game is a work in progress and may change in the future. Stay tuned!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3510740?t=1752859895","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3510740?t=1752859895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510740/1838b528746c84f564b7debeed45221c5850be09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752859895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510740/1838b528746c84f564b7debeed45221c5850be09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752859895","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever played real golf? It's nothing like most golf games. You don't just tap a few buttons  and then hit a perfect 250 yard drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In real golf, you miss. You slice. You swear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luke Muscat's Ultimate Golf Challenge is the most accurate simulation of the amateur golfer experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and detailed club swing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult and  surreal challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Motion Video mixed with 3D courses</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luke Muscat's Ultimate Golf Challenge was built almost entirely by me, Luke Muscat. Back in the Old Times I was creator of Jetpack Joyride and Fruit Ninja. A couple of years ago I decided I wanted to try the ultimate game dev challenge and make a game completely solo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired by some weird combination of Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy, Trickshot Simulator, and Jetpack Joyride. Yeah, I know. I'm also  documenting the development process on YouTube if you want to see how the sausage is made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This game is a work in progress and may change in the future. Stay tuned!</i></p>","developers":["Luke Muscat"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510740/f802aaa9aa3360e9116215aed58229f280f6b997/header.jpg?t=1752859895","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Monterey (12.0)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3510740/280528363/11013b90b1952e6f7f4ebf4068b4543a48ea93e0/1752708620/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752763733","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3510740/280528363/11013b90b1952e6f7f4ebf4068b4543a48ea93e0/1752708620/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752763733","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3510740/280528363/11013b90b1952e6f7f4ebf4068b4543a48ea93e0/1752708620/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752763733","id":257169495,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169495/movie480.mp4?t=1752763733","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169495/movie_max.mp4?t=1752763733"},"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257169495/818b5908a56af5a0864167a4d85f9630470b7793/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752763733","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169495/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752763733","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169495/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752763733"}}],"name":"Luke Muscat's Ultimate Golf Challenge","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 Series<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Luke Muscat